          <button onclick="window.print()" style="padding: 5px 16px; border-radius: 6px; border: none; background: #10b981; color: #fff; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 700; font-size: 12px;">🖨️ প্রিন্ট / PDF ডাউনলোড</button>
